# Observability

Prefer structured, actionable diagnostics that distinguish:

- Authn vs authz failure
- Backend connectivity vs gateway offline
- Stale telemetry vs zero measurement
- Modbus/link vs cloud contact
- Alarm vs notification delivery failure

Never log passwords, private keys, tokens, API secrets, plaintext device credentials, or sensitive user data without justified need. Avoid generic errors when context is available.
